      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The prophet urges Israel to pursue the knowledge of the LORD, whose going forth is as certain as the morning dawn, and who will come to His people like the rain—like the latter and former rain watering the dry earth. First principle: God's presence and revival come as life-restoring rain upon penitent hearts.",
