    {
      "entryId": "hos-6-2",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "After two days will he revive us: in the third day he will raise us up, and we shall live in his sight. Israel's national revival is couched in resurrection rhythm. First principle: the third day is God's appointed turning point — and the early church confessed it as according to the scriptures.",
