    {
      "entryId": "hos-11-1",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "When Israel was a child, then I loved him, and called my son out of Egypt. What Israel embodied poorly, the true Son embodies perfectly: God calls His Son up out of Egypt after Herod's wrath. First principle: Israel's history is prophetic pattern; Christ relives and fulfills it.",
