      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The renamed children: My-people and Having-obtained-mercy. First principle: Hosea's children are walking prophecies — Lo-ammi becomes Ammi on God's say-so, the sermon preached by name.",
